DESCRIPTION:NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice. \nQuarterly forum that engages stakeholders in review of market performance issues and in high level dialogue on release planning, implementation and policy initiatives status.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nTBD\nCategories\nMarkets\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m0846ccb6140b9b0387a6abf50682a52e \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25301443847\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\n\nBrenda Marquez at bmarquez@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/market-performance-and-planning-forum-q2-apr-29-2026-0900-am
