BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:222929@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260409T200000Z
DTEND:20260409T230000Z
SUMMARY:Tribal Meeting on FERC Order No. 1920 and Long-term Transmission Planning
DESCRIPTION:Event description\nThe California ISO (CAISO) will host a joint hybrid meeting with the California Public Utilities Commission (CPUC) and the California Energy Commission (CEC) for Tribes and Tribal representatives on FERC Order No. 1920 and CAISO transmission planning on Apr. 9, 2026, from 1-4 p.m. Pacific Time. The ISO seeks to facilitate conversations with Tribes to incorporate Tribal laws and regulations into long-term transmission planning.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nOverview of FERC Order No. 1920 and CAISO’s transmission planning processes, as well as the respective roles and responsibilities of CAISO, the CPUC, and the CEC in electric system planning.  \nInform Tribes about CAISO transmission planning and FERC Order No. 1920\nGather feedback on how Tribes would like to engage in future transmission planning processes. \nProvide an opportunity for Tribes to learn about the coordinated joint agency and ISO planning processes\nShare feedback with the ISO on how Tribes would like to participate in this future dialogue with the ISO.\nWho should attend?\nTribes and tribal representatives\nCategories\nPlanning\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at TBD\nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: TBD\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information \nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/tribal-meeting-on-ferc-order-no-1920-and-long-term-transmission-planning \n\nPlease contact Tribal Affairs tribalaffairs@caiso.com with any questions\n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/tribal-meeting-on-ferc-order-no-1920-and-long-term-transmission-planning-apr-09-2026-0100-pm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Event description</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">The California ISO (CAISO) will host a joint hybrid meeting with the California Public Utilities Commission (CPUC) and the California Energy Commission (CEC) for Tribes and Tribal representatives on FERC Order No. 1920 and CAISO transmission planning on Apr. 9, 2026, from 1-4 p.m. Pacific Time. The ISO seeks to facilitate conversations with Tribes to incorporate Tribal laws and regulations into long-term transmission planning.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Overview of FERC Order No. 1920 and CAISO’s transmission planning processes, as well as the respective roles and responsibilities of CAISO, the CPUC, and the CEC in electric system planning.   </p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Inform Tribes about CAISO transmission planning and FERC Order No. 1920</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Gather feedback on how Tribes would like to engage in future transmission planning processes.  </p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Provide an opportunity for Tribes to learn about the coordinated joint agency and ISO planning processes</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Share feedback with the ISO on how Tribes would like to participate in this future dialogue with the ISO.</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Tribes and tribal representatives</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Planning</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at TBD</p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: TBD</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information  </strong></p><p><strong>Meeting notice </strong>- <a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/tribal-meeting-on-ferc-order-no-1920-and-long-term-transmission-planning" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/tribal-meeting-on-ferc-order-no-1920-and-long-term-transmission-planning</a></p></div><div><p>Please contact Tribal Affairs <a href="mailto:tribalaffairs@caiso.com">tribalaffairs@caiso.com</a> with any questions</p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/tribal-meeting-on-ferc-order-no-1920-and-long-term-transmission-planning-apr-09-2026-0100-pm" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/tribal-meeting-on-ferc-order-no-1920-and-long-term-transmission-planning-apr-09-2026-0100-pm
DTSTAMP:20260206T171200Z
END:VEVENT
