UID:199618@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260409T160000Z
DTEND:20260409T190000Z
SUMMARY:Tentative: 2027 Local Capacity Requirements Technical Study Draft Results
DESCRIPTION:NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice. \nThe California ISO is conducting the local capacity technical study per section 40.3.1 of the ISO tariff and will hold a public stakeholder call on April 9, 2026, to present and discuss the proposed final 2027 and 2031 local capacity technical study results.\nThe draft 2026 and 2031 local capacity technical study reports and presentations with the final study results will be posted on the 2027 Local Capacity Requirements Process webpage.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nThe proposed draft 2027 and 2031 local capacity technical study results\nCategories?\nLegal and regulatory\nMarkets\nPlanning\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m76d2892bfbe05d4afd8551d8183b0146 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25363385898\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nhttps://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/RecurringStakeholderProcesses/Local-capacity-requirements-process-2027 \n\nYelena Kopylov-Alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com\n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/2027-local-capacity-requirements-technical-study-draft-results-apr-09-2026-0900-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p><i><strong>NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice.  </strong></i></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">The California ISO is conducting the local capacity technical study per section 40.3.1 of the ISO tariff and will hold a public stakeholder call on April 9, 2026, to present and discuss the proposed final 2027 and 2031 local capacity technical study results.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;">The draft 2026 and 2031 local capacity technical study reports and presentations with the final study results will be posted on the <a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/RecurringStakeholderProcesses/Local-capacity-requirements-process-2027" rel="noreferrer noopener">2027 Local Capacity Requirements Process webpage</a>.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">The proposed draft 2027 and 2031 local capacity technical study results</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories?</strong></p><p>Legal and regulatory</p><p>Markets</p><p>Planning</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m76d2892bfbe05d4afd8551d8183b0146" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m76d2892bfbe05d4afd8551d8183b0146</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25363385898</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/RecurringStakeholderProcesses/Local-capacity-requirements-process-2027" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/RecurringStakeholderProcesses/Local-capacity-requirements-process-2027</a></p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-Alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com</p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/2027-local-capacity-requirements-technical-study-draft-results-apr-09-2026-0900-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
