BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:223698@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260310T170000Z
DTEND:20260310T190000Z
SUMMARY:Training - Scheduling Infrastructure and Business Rules (SIBR) Fundamentals
DESCRIPTION:What topics will be covered?   \nThis session will provide an overview of the fundamentals of the Scheduling Infrastructure and Business Rules (SIBR) application. It will guide users through the core interface, demonstrate how to submit and validate Energy and Ancillary Services bids, and review the resulting outputs.\nWho should attend?\nThe primary audience for this training is SIBR UI users. Specifically, staff from entities who are responsible for submitting or validating economic bids and self-schedules in the Day-Ahead Market, whether through SIBR or their own third-party software.\nWeb and audio participation information\nRegistration is required for this training session - \nhttps://caiso.regfox.com/scheduling-infrastructure-and-business-rules-sibr-fundamentals\nYou will receive Webex login information in a confirmation email.\nRelated information\nThe session will be recorded and posted to the ISO Training center, Western Energy Markets webpage a few days after the event.\n\nPlease contact CustomerReadiness@caiso.com for questions about this session. \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/training-scheduling-infrastructure-and-business-rules-sibr-fundamentals-mar-10-2026-1000-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?     </strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">This session will provide an overview of the fundamentals of the Scheduling Infrastructure and Business Rules (SIBR) application. It will guide users through the core interface, demonstrate how to submit and validate Energy and Ancillary Services bids, and review the resulting outputs.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">The primary audience for this training is SIBR UI users. Specifically, staff from entities who are responsible for submitting or validating economic bids and self-schedules in the Day-Ahead Market, whether through SIBR or their own third-party software.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Registration is required for this training session -  </p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.regfox.com/scheduling-infrastructure-and-business-rules-sibr-fundamentals" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://caiso.regfox.com/scheduling-infrastructure-and-business-rules-sibr-fundamentals</a></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">You will receive Webex login information in a confirmation email.</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">The session will be recorded and posted to the <a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/stakeholder/training/western-energy-markets" rel="noreferrer noopener">ISO Training center, Western Energy Markets webpage</a> a few days after the event.</p></div><div><p>Please contact <a href="mailto:CustomerReadiness@caiso.com">CustomerReadiness@caiso.com</a> for questions about this session.  </p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/training-scheduling-infrastructure-and-business-rules-sibr-fundamentals-mar-10-2026-1000-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/training-scheduling-infrastructure-and-business-rules-sibr-fundamentals-mar-10-2026-1000-am
DTSTAMP:20260218T180000Z
END:VEVENT
