UID:199616@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260309T160000Z
DTEND:20260309T220000Z
SUMMARY:2027 Local Capacity Requirements Technical Study Draft Results
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO is conducting the local capacity technical study per section 40.3.1 of the ISO tariff, and will hold a stakeholder call on Mar. 9, 2026, to present and discuss the proposed draft 2027 and 2031 local capacity technical study results. \nWhat topics will be covered?\nThe proposed draft 2027 and 2031 local capacity technical study results\nCategories\nLegal and regulatoryMarketsPlanningWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m76d2892bfbe05d4afd8551d8183b0146  \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25363385898\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\n\nYelena Kopylov-Alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/2027-local-capacity-requirements-technical-study-draft-results-mar-09-2026-0900-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The California ISO is conducting the local capacity technical study per section 40.3.1 of the ISO tariff, and will hold a stakeholder call on Mar. 9, 2026, to present and discuss the proposed draft 2027 and 2031 local capacity technical study results.  </p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">The proposed draft 2027 and 2031 local capacity technical study results</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories</strong></p><ul><li>Legal and regulatory</li><li>Markets</li><li>Planning</li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m76d2892bfbe05d4afd8551d8183b0146" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m76d2892bfbe05d4afd8551d8183b0146</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25363385898</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-Alford, <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/2027-local-capacity-requirements-technical-study-draft-results-mar-09-2026-0900-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
