SUMMARY:Flexible Capacity Requirement Methodology for 2027 through 2029
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO will hold a public stakeholder call on Feb. 18, 2026, to discuss the Flexible Capacity Requirement Methodology for 2027 through 2029. \nWhat topics will be covered?\nInformation on the process and methodology for calculating the 2027 Flexible Capacity Needs and Availability Assessment hours\nCategories\nMarkets\nPlanning\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m0ba8f28bac6a77ffe5b9a7bc9941b66e \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 25346568894\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/flexible-capacity-requirement-methodology-for-2027-through-2029-call-on-2-18-26   \n\nYelena Kopylov-Alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/flexible-capacity-requirement-methodology-for-2027-through-2029-feb-18-2026-0900-am
