SUMMARY:Parallel Operations - DAME, EDAM, EDAM CAISO Balancing Authority Area Participation Rules Market Simulation and Parallel Ops Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The purpose of this meeting is to provide a comprehensive update on Market Simulation and Parallel Operations activities, including current status, known issues with estimated resolution timelines, planned patching and environment availability, and progress on executed structured scenarios. The session will also cover overall status and outline next steps to ensure alignment and transparency.\nWho should attend?\nOpen to all market participants\nWeb and audio participation information\nThis group will meet every Monday from 9:00a.m. - 10:00a.m. PT &amp;amp; Thursday 1:00pm - 2:00pm PT\nStep 1: join web conference at https://caiso.webex.com/wbxmjs/joinservice/sites/caiso/meeting/download/545c67fb807e451abd5f0b504dc5fd89?MTID=md592dda61a00761ceff7d456e7178278 \n\nRegistration required via CIDI; those who have been participating in the Market Sim meetings do NOT need to reregister.\n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/parallel-operations-dame-edam-edam-caiso-balancing-authority-area-participation-rules-market-simulation-and-parallel-ops-meeting-feb-12-2026-0100-pm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The purpose of this meeting is to provide a comprehensive update on Market Simulation and Parallel Operations activities, including current status, known issues with estimated resolution timelines, planned patching and environment availability, and progress on executed structured scenarios. The session will also cover overall status and outline next steps to ensure alignment and transparency.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Open to all market participants</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>This group will meet every Monday from 9:00a.m. - 10:00a.m. PT &amp; Thursday 1:00pm - 2:00pm PT</p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.webex.com/wbxmjs/joinservice/sites/caiso/meeting/download/545c67fb807e451abd5f0b504dc5fd89?MTID=md592dda61a00761ceff7d456e7178278" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://caiso.webex.com/wbxmjs/joinservice/sites/caiso/meeting/download/545c67fb807e451abd5f0b504dc5fd89?MTID=md592dda61a00761ceff7d456e7178278</a></p></div><div><p style="margin-left:0in;">Registration required via CIDI; those who have been participating in the Market Sim meetings do NOT need to reregister.</p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/parallel-operations-dame-edam-edam-caiso-balancing-authority-area-participation-rules-market-simulation-and-parallel-ops-meeting-feb-12-2026-0100-pm" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
