SUMMARY:Large Load Information Session
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO has posted an issue paper on large load considerations, and will host a public stakeholder information session on Feb. 5, 2026.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nDiscuss issue paper \nCategories\nPlanning \nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=ma1ba9e1a047b1a018fbbeb9cbb171361 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25340598356\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nhttps://www.caiso.com/generation-transmission/load/large-load#next%20step \nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/large-load-considerations-issue-paper-will-be-posted-on-1-30-26-information-session-on-2-5-26 \n\nYelena Kopylov-Alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/large-load-information-session-feb-05-2026-0900-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;">The California ISO has posted an issue paper on large load considerations, and will host a public stakeholder information session on Feb. 5, 2026.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Discuss issue paper  </p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Planning  </p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=ma1ba9e1a047b1a018fbbeb9cbb171361" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=ma1ba9e1a047b1a018fbbeb9cbb171361</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25340598356</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/generation-transmission/load/large-load#next%20step" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/generation-transmission/load/large-load#next%20step</a></p><p><strong>Meeting notice</strong> - <a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/large-load-considerations-issue-paper-will-be-posted-on-1-30-26-information-session-on-2-5-26" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/large-load-considerations-issue-paper-will-be-posted-on-1-30-26-information-session-on-2-5-26</a></p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-Alford, <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/large-load-information-session-feb-05-2026-0900-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
