SUMMARY:Extended Day-Ahead Market (EDAM) - Virtual Town Hall
DESCRIPTION:The ISO invites you to join a virtual town hall on Wednesday, Feb. 4, 2026, at 10:00 a.m. (PST). This session will spotlight the positive momentum of market advancements and the collaborative progress shaping the future of EDAM. Designed for regulators, policymakers, and stakeholders, the town hall will provide a clear, forward-looking view of recent developments and what they mean for the West. Attendees will have an opportunity to ask questions following the presentations.\n\nPlease save the date and register for the event. \n \nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m2cae16e1b17837d2d385df31c569e711\nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call1 1-650-479-3208 , access code: 25323466086\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202 \n\nAdam Schultz at aschultz@caiso.com or (916) 693-7624\n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-virtual-town-hall-feb-04-2026-1000-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The ISO invites you to join a virtual town hall on Wednesday, Feb. 4, 2026, at 10:00 a.m. (PST). This session will spotlight the positive momentum of market advancements and the collaborative progress shaping the future of EDAM. Designed for regulators, policymakers, and stakeholders, the town hall will provide a clear, forward-looking view of recent developments and what they mean for the West. Attendees will have an opportunity to ask questions following the presentations.<br /><br /><strong>Please save the date and </strong><a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.regfox.com/extended-day-ahead-market-virtual-town-hall-feb-4" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>register for the event.</strong></a><strong></strong><br /></p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m2cae16e1b17837d2d385df31c569e711" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m2cae16e1b17837d2d385df31c569e711</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call1 1-650-479-3208  , access code: 25323466086</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202  </p></div><div><p>Adam Schultz at <a href="mailto:aschultz@caiso.com">aschultz@caiso.com</a> or (916) 693-7624</p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-virtual-town-hall-feb-04-2026-1000-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
