UID:228374@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260731T160000Z
DTEND:20260731T190000Z
LOCATION:Seattle City Hall - Bertha Knight Landes Room (5th avenue entrance) 600 4th Ave, Seattle, WA 98104
SUMMARY:Market Seams Workshop
DESCRIPTION:NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice. \nThe California ISO has scheduled a July 31, 2026, hybrid Market Seams workshop. This will be the first workshop in a series for education and discussion on market-to-market seams.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nOverview of Western market seams\nCharacterization of seams issues from a panel of industry experts\nPerspectives on seams from a panel of state regulatorsCategories\nMarkets\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m0aa1837cd47ecde1544cc055cbf5d1c5 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25370755107\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nRegistration is required for in-person attendance - Please register for this event if you plan to attend in person.\nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/market-seams-workshop-on-7-31-26 \n\nChristina Guimera, cguimera@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/market-seams-workshop-jul-31-2026-0900-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p><i><strong>NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice.  </strong></i></p><p>The California ISO has scheduled a July 31, 2026, hybrid Market Seams workshop. This will be the first workshop in a series for education and discussion on market-to-market seams.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Overview of Western market seams</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Characterization of seams issues from a panel of industry experts</p></li><li>Perspectives on seams from a panel of state regulators</li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Markets</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m0aa1837cd47ecde1544cc055cbf5d1c5" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m0aa1837cd47ecde1544cc055cbf5d1c5</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25370755107</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Registration is required for in-person attendance - </strong><a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.regfox.com/market-seams-meeting" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>Please register for this event if you plan to attend in person.</strong></a></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Meeting notice - <a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/market-seams-workshop-on-7-31-26" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/market-seams-workshop-on-7-31-26</a></p></div><div><p>Christina Guimera, <a href="mailto:cguimera@caiso.com">cguimera@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/market-seams-workshop-jul-31-2026-0900-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/market-seams-workshop-jul-31-2026-0900-am
