SUMMARY:Tentative: Market Performance and Planning Forum Q3
DESCRIPTION:NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice. \nQuarterly forum that engages stakeholders in review of market performance issues and in high level dialogue on release planning, implementation and policy initiatives status.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nTBD\nCategories\nMarkets\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m3d970931fa8cb687d6e2cf3c9c5c3d97 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25318048011\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\n\nBrenda Marquez at bmarquez@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/market-performance-and-planning-forum-q3-jul-30-2026-0900-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p><i><strong>NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice.  </strong></i></p><p>Quarterly  forum that engages stakeholders in review of market performance issues and in high level dialogue on release planning, implementation and policy initiatives status.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">TBD</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Markets</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m3d970931fa8cb687d6e2cf3c9c5c3d97" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m3d970931fa8cb687d6e2cf3c9c5c3d97</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25318048011</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p></div><div><p>Brenda Marquez at <a href="mailto:bmarquez@caiso.com">bmarquez@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/market-performance-and-planning-forum-q3-jul-30-2026-0900-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
