SUMMARY:Transmission Development Forum
DESCRIPTION:NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice. \nThe California ISO, in conjunction with the California Public Utilities Commission and the participating transmission owners, will hold its biannual stakeholder call on Jan. 28, 2026, to provide status updates on the transmission planning process and network upgrades identified in the generation interconnection process.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nTransmission Planning Process status updates \nNetwork upgrades in the generation interconnection process \nCategory\nPlanning \nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m4b4433aa823527fc2cb86a469e258d96 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25352273072\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nhttps://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/RecurringStakeholderProcesses/Transmission-development-forum \n\nYelena Kopylov-alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/transmission-development-forum-jul-29-2026-0900-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p><i><strong>NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice.  </strong></i></p><p>The California ISO, in conjunction with the California Public Utilities Commission and the participating transmission owners, will hold its biannual stakeholder call on Jan. 28, 2026, to provide status updates on the transmission planning process and network upgrades identified in the generation interconnection process.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Transmission Planning Process status updates  </p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Network upgrades in the generation interconnection process  </p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Category</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Planning  </p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m4b4433aa823527fc2cb86a469e258d96" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m4b4433aa823527fc2cb86a469e258d96</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25352273072</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/RecurringStakeholderProcesses/Transmission-development-forum" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/RecurringStakeholderProcesses/Transmission-development-forum</a></p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-alford, <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/transmission-development-forum-jul-29-2026-0900-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/transmission-development-forum-jul-29-2026-0900-am
