X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Monthly review of Proposed Revision Requests (PRRs) in process for CAISO Business Practice Manuals (BPM).</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Market participants</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Local regulatory authority</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Entity representing a market participant</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.webex.com/caiso/j.php?MTID=m3c58e1255471fcbcbe28ab8532673ac8" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://caiso.webex.com/caiso/j.php?MTID=m3c58e1255471fcbcbe28ab8532673ac8</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956 with access code 2493 529 8252.</p><p>Technical support: Go to <a target="_blank" href="https://help.webex.com" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://help.webex.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="mailto:BPM_CM@caiso.com">BPM_CM@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/bpm-change-management-proposed-revision-request-review-jul-28-2026-1100-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
