BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:233648@caiso.com
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260616
SUMMARY:Comments due - Congestion Revenue Rights Enhancements
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO will host a stakeholder meeting for the Congestion Revenue Rights (CRR) Enhancements initiative on June 2, 2026, from 9 a.m. to 12 p.m. The purpose of the meeting is to further discuss potential enhancements related to auction efficiency and revenue adequacy.\nPlease submit written comments in response to the discussion by end of day June 16, 2026, using the ISO’s commenting tool available on the Congestion revenue rights enhancements webpage.  \n\nBrenda Marquez at bmarquez@caiso.com or ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-congestion-revenue-rights-enhancements-jun-16-2026-1200-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The California ISO will host a stakeholder meeting for the Congestion Revenue Rights (CRR) Enhancements initiative on June 2, 2026, from 9 a.m. to 12 p.m. The purpose of the meeting is to further discuss potential enhancements related to auction efficiency and revenue adequacy.</p><p>Please submit written comments in response to the discussion by end of day June 16, 2026, using the ISO’s commenting tool available on the <a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Congestion-revenue-rights-enhancements" rel="noreferrer noopener">Congestion revenue rights enhancements webpage</a>.   </p></div><div><p>Brenda Marquez at <a href="mailto:bmarquez@caiso.com">bmarquez@caiso.com</a> or <a href="mailto:ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com">ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-congestion-revenue-rights-enhancements-jun-16-2026-1200-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-congestion-revenue-rights-enhancements-jun-16-2026-1200-am
DTSTAMP:20260520T161300Z
END:VEVENT
