DESCRIPTION:The second revised straw proposal for the Storage Design and Modeling – Outage Management Topic Group will be discussed at the stakeholder meeting scheduled for May 18, 2026. Please submit written comments on the second revised straw proposal through the ISO’s commenting tool on the Storage design and modeling webpage. \n\nBrenda Marquez at bmarquez@caiso.com or ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-storage-design-and-modeling-jun-05-2026-1200-am
