BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:233709@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260604T180000Z
DTEND:20260604T190000Z
SUMMARY:2026 Variable Operations and Maintenance (VOM) Cost Review
DESCRIPTION:What topics will be covered?\nThrough this recurring triennial stakeholder process, the California Independent System Operator (ISO) will review the default variable operations and maintenance (VOM) adders and update these values as needed. The ISO will also introduce a new default value for the variable storage operations cost.\nWho should attend?\nStakeholders for VOM\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m5b8ee1b1d0d46aec4e64b9eb260485e3 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25358007368\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nTBD\n\nBrenda Marquez, bmarquez@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/2026-variable-operations-and-maintenance-vom-cost-review-jun-04-2026-1100-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><p>Through this recurring triennial stakeholder process, the California Independent System Operator (ISO)  will review the default variable operations and maintenance (VOM) adders and update these values as needed. The ISO will also introduce a new default value for the variable storage operations cost.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Stakeholders for VOM</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m5b8ee1b1d0d46aec4e64b9eb260485e3__;!!ETlorfI!hc_uWvYDHxuVP1KZEh2NIVd0ET0gd8AvYZvuz6XYulLtxbebDSlLWZFMqHUIJ1uRADUoTJbowcnDjYJ1Th7nfilQ$" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m5b8ee1b1d0d46aec4e64b9eb260485e3</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25358007368</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p>TBD</p></div><div><p>Brenda Marquez, <a href="mailto:bmarquez@caiso.com">bmarquez@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/2026-variable-operations-and-maintenance-vom-cost-review-jun-04-2026-1100-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/2026-variable-operations-and-maintenance-vom-cost-review-jun-04-2026-1100-am
