BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:231520@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260603T200000Z
DTEND:20260603T220000Z
SUMMARY:Refresher Training - Resource Performance Expectations
DESCRIPTION:Who should attend?\nThis course is designed for Resource Owners/Operators and their Scheduling Coordinators who schedule and operate resources in the ISO market and bulk electric system. It is recommended for any Market Participant that has received a dispatch or operating instruction with which they were unable to comply, as well as for those who are new to scheduling in the ISO market or seeking to strengthen their existing knowledge.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nThis training will include the following topics:\nDescribe how resources are expected to respond to dispatch and operating instructions.\nExplain the importance of communication before, during, and after testing resources. \nIdentify the potential compliance consequences due to failure to comply with dispatch and operating instructions. \nDescribe how to monitor and respond to alarms and instructions in the Automated Dispatch System (ADS).\nReview communication protocols and responsibilities.\nProvide accurate and complete information in the outage card.\nWeb and audio participation information\nRegistration is required for this training, please register to receive participation details.\nPre-registration is not required — you may register in advance or on the day of the session.\nAfter registering, you will receive a confirmation email containing your personalized Webex login details and a calendar invite that you can add directly to your schedule.\nImportant — Each participant must register individually. Please do not forward the registration link or your confirmation email to teammates, as access is unique to each registrant.\n\nPlease reach out to CustomerReadiness@caiso.com for questions about this training.\n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/refresher-training-resource-performance-expectations-jun-03-2026-0100-pm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0.25pt;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0.25pt;">This course is designed for Resource Owners/Operators and their Scheduling Coordinators who schedule and operate resources in the ISO market and bulk electric system. It is recommended for any Market Participant that has received a dispatch or operating instruction with which they were unable to comply, as well as for those who are new to scheduling in the ISO market or seeking to strengthen their existing knowledge.</p><p style="margin-left:0.25pt;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0.25pt;">This training will include the following topics:</p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;"><li><p style="margin-left:17.75pt;">Describe how resources are expected to respond to dispatch and operating instructions.</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:17.75pt;">Explain the importance of communication before, during, and after testing resources.  </p></li><li><p style="margin-left:17.75pt;">Identify the potential compliance consequences due to failure to comply with dispatch and operating instructions.  </p></li><li><p style="margin-left:17.75pt;">Describe how to monitor and respond to alarms and instructions in the Automated Dispatch System (ADS).</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:17.75pt;">Review communication protocols and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:17.75pt;">Provide accurate and complete information in the outage card.</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Registration is required for this training, <a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.webex.com/weblink/register/rd1500dc4e3b8be0c2a808d81f13d20dc" rel="noreferrer noopener">please register to receive participation details.</a></p><p>Pre-registration is not required — you may register in advance or on the day of the session.</p><p>After registering, you will receive a confirmation email containing your personalized Webex login details and a calendar invite that you can add directly to your schedule.</p><p><strong>Important </strong>— Each participant must register individually. Please do not forward the registration link or your confirmation email to teammates, as access is unique to each registrant.</p></div><div><p>Please reach out to <a href="mailto:CustomerReadiness@caiso.com">CustomerReadiness@caiso.com</a> for questions about this training.</p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/refresher-training-resource-performance-expectations-jun-03-2026-0100-pm" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/refresher-training-resource-performance-expectations-jun-03-2026-0100-pm
DTSTAMP:20260429T165000Z
END:VEVENT
