SUMMARY:Interconnection Process Enhancements 5.0 - Draft Tariff Language
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO has posted the draft tariff language for the Interconnection Process Enhancements 5.0 initiative on May 18, 2026, and will host a public stakeholder meeting to discuss the proposed revisions on Jun. 1, 2026. This document is available on the Interconnection Process Enhancements 5.0 initiative webpage.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nDiscuss the proposed revisions on the draft tariff language\nCategories\nMarkets\nOperations\nPlanning\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m393773321fc1de03e4894afca38d0bed \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25395391197\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-draft-tariff-language-posted-call-on-6-1-26 \n\nYelena Kopylov-Alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-draft-tariff-language-jun-01-2026-1000-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The California ISO has posted the draft tariff language for the Interconnection Process Enhancements 5.0 initiative on May 18, 2026, and will host a public stakeholder meeting to discuss the proposed revisions on Jun. 1, 2026. This document is available on the Interconnection Process Enhancements 5.0 initiative webpage.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Discuss the proposed revisions on the draft tariff language</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Markets</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Operations</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Planning</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m393773321fc1de03e4894afca38d0bed" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m393773321fc1de03e4894afca38d0bed</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25395391197</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p>Meeting notice - <a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-draft-tariff-language-posted-call-on-6-1-26" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-draft-tariff-language-posted-call-on-6-1-26</a></p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-Alford, <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-draft-tariff-language-jun-01-2026-1000-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
