UID:219767@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260526T200000Z
DTEND:20260526T210000Z
SUMMARY:Interconnection Customer User Group
DESCRIPTION:The Interconnection Customer User Group bi-weekly call provides an opportunity for CAISO interconnection customers to discuss industry questions and concerns regarding infrastructure policies and processes, including transmission planning and development, interconnection, deliverability, and contracting. This group will meet every other Tuesday from 1 - 2 p.m.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nAgendas will generally be industry drivenTopic suggestions are due by close of business on the Wednesday prior to the meeting to ykopylovalford@caiso.com or ISOStakeholderAffairs@caiso.comA high-level agenda will be posted here by close of business the day prior to the meetingWho should attend?\nThis call is open only to CAISO Interconnection Customers and state agency representatives.Registration is required for this meeting - Interconnection Customer User Group Registration Link \nRelated Information \nNotice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-customer-user-group-call-3-18-25 \n\nYelena Kopylov-alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-customer-user-group-may-26-2026-0100-pm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The Interconnection Customer User Group bi-weekly call provides an opportunity for CAISO interconnection customers to discuss industry questions and concerns regarding infrastructure policies and processes, including transmission planning and development, interconnection, deliverability, and contracting. This group will meet every other Tuesday from 1 - 2 p.m.</p><p><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;"><li>Agendas will generally be industry driven</li><li>Topic suggestions are due by close of business on the Wednesday prior to the meeting to <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a> or <a href="mailto:ISOStakeholderAffairs@caiso.com">ISOStakeholderAffairs@caiso.com</a></li><li>A high-level agenda will be posted here by close of business the day prior to the meeting</li></ul><p><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;"><li>This call is open only to CAISO Interconnection Customers and state agency representatives.</li></ul><p>Registration is required for this meeting<i><strong> -  </strong></i><a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.regfox.com/interconnection-customer-user-group-march-18-2025" rel="noreferrer noopener"><i><strong>Interconnection Customer User Group Registration Link</strong></i></a></p><p><strong>Related Information  </strong></p><p>Notice -<strong></strong><a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-customer-user-group-call-3-18-25" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-customer-user-group-call-3-18-25</a></p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-alford, <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-customer-user-group-may-26-2026-0100-pm" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-customer-user-group-may-26-2026-0100-pm
DTSTAMP:20251219T011200Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:220109@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260526T180000Z
DTEND:20260526T190000Z
SUMMARY:BPM Change Management Proposed Revision Request Review
DESCRIPTION:What topics will be covered?\nMonthly review of Proposed Revision Requests (PRRs) in process for CAISO Business Practice Manuals (BPM).\nWho should attend?\nMarket participants\nLocal regulatory authority\nEntity representing a market participant\nWeb and audio participation information\nRegistration is required for this training, please register to receive participation details.Pre-registration is not required—you may register in advance or on the day of the session.After registering, you will receive a confirmation email containing your personalized Webex login details and a calendar invite that you can add directly to your schedule.Important: Each participant must register individually. Please do not forward the registration link or your confirmation email to teammates, as access is unique to each registrant.\nBPM_CM@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/bpm-change-management-proposed-revision-request-review-may-26-2026-1100-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Monthly review of Proposed Revision Requests (PRRs) in process for CAISO Business Practice Manuals (BPM).</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Market participants</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Local regulatory authority</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Entity representing a market participant</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;"><li>Registration is required for this training,  <a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.webex.com/weblink/register/rcf7ef0859af2d055face76b53b98632a" rel="noreferrer noopener">please register to receive participation details</a>.</li><li>Pre-registration is not required—you may register in advance  <i>or</i>  on the day of the session.</li><li>After registering, you will receive a confirmation email containing your personalized Webex login details and a calendar invite that you can add directly to your schedule.</li><li>Important:  Each participant must register individually. Please do not forward the registration link or your confirmation email to teammates, as access is unique to each registrant.</li></ul></div><div><p><a href="mailto:BPM_CM@caiso.com">BPM_CM@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/bpm-change-management-proposed-revision-request-review-may-26-2026-1100-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/bpm-change-management-proposed-revision-request-review-may-26-2026-1100-am
DTSTAMP:20251224T170600Z
END:VEVENT
