BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:226786@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260518T200000Z
DTEND:20260518T220000Z
SUMMARY:Interconnection Service Capacity and Deliverability Retention for Non-Operating Generating Facilities - Draft Final Proposal
DESCRIPTION:The objective of this initiative is to codify and clarify policy that defines a Generating Facility’s rights to retain Deliverability and Interconnection Service Capacity when a generator ceases operation.\nThis meeting will discuss the draft final proposal. \nWhat topics will be covered?\nDiscuss the Draft Final Proposal \nWho should attend?\nLegal and Regulatory\nMarket Operations\nPlanning\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m3024504fce9dba3f11862273f5251a1a \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25378726853\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-service-capacity-and-deliverability-retention-for-non-operating-generating-facilities-draft-final-proposal-posted--call-on-5-18-26 \nhttps://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Interconnection-Service-Capacity-Deliverability-Retention-for-Non-Operating-Generating-Facilities \n\nYelena Kopylov-Alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-service-capacity-and-deliverability-retention-for-non-operating-generating-facilities-draft-final-proposal-may-18-2026-0100-pm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The objective of this initiative is to codify and clarify policy that defines a Generating Facility’s rights to retain Deliverability and Interconnection Service Capacity when a generator ceases operation.</p><p>This meeting will discuss the draft final proposal.  </p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Discuss the Draft Final Proposal  </p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Legal and Regulatory</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Market Operations</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Planning</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m3024504fce9dba3f11862273f5251a1a" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m3024504fce9dba3f11862273f5251a1a</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25378726853</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p>Meeting notice - <a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-service-capacity-and-deliverability-retention-for-non-operating-generating-facilities-draft-final-proposal-posted--call-on-5-18-26" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-service-capacity-and-deliverability-retention-for-non-operating-generating-facilities-draft-final-proposal-posted--call-on-5-18-26</a></p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Interconnection-Service-Capacity-Deliverability-Retention-for-Non-Operating-Generating-Facilities" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Interconnection-Service-Capacity-Deliverability-Retention-for-Non-Operating-Generating-Facilities</a></p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-Alford, <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-service-capacity-and-deliverability-retention-for-non-operating-generating-facilities-draft-final-proposal-may-18-2026-0100-pm" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
