DTSTART:20260512T200000Z
DTEND:20260512T210000Z
SUMMARY:Interconnection Customer User Group
DESCRIPTION:The Interconnection Customer User Group bi-weekly call provides an opportunity for CAISO interconnection customers to discuss industry questions and concerns regarding infrastructure policies and processes, including transmission planning and development, interconnection, deliverability, and contracting. This group will meet every other Tuesday from 1:00-2:00p.m.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nAgendas will generally be industry-driven.Topic suggestions are due by close of business on the Wednesday prior to the meeting to ykopylovalford@caiso.com or ISOStakeholderAffairs@caiso.com.A high-level agenda will be posted here by close of business the day prior to the meeting.Who should attend?\nThis call is open only to CAISO Interconnection Customers and state agency representatives.Registration is required for this meeting - Interconnection Customer User Group Registration LinkRelated information\nNotice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-customer-user-group-call-3-18-25 \n\nYelena Kopylov-alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-customer-user-group-may-12-2026-0100-pm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;">The Interconnection Customer User Group bi-weekly call provides an opportunity for CAISO interconnection customers to discuss industry questions and concerns regarding infrastructure policies and processes, including transmission planning and development, interconnection, deliverability, and contracting. This group will meet every other Tuesday from 1:00-2:00p.m.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;"><li>Agendas will generally be industry-driven.</li><li>Topic suggestions are due by close of business on the Wednesday prior to the meeting to <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a> or <a href="mailto:ISOStakeholderAffairs@caiso.com">ISOStakeholderAffairs@caiso.com</a>.</li><li>A high-level agenda will be posted here by close of business the day prior to the meeting.</li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;"><li>This call is open only to CAISO Interconnection Customers and state agency representatives.</li><li><i><strong>Registration is required for this meeting - </strong></i><a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.regfox.com/interconnection-customer-user-group-march-18-2025" rel="noreferrer noopener"><i><strong>Interconnection Customer User Group Registration Link</strong></i></a></li></ul><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p>Notice -<strong></strong><a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-customer-user-group-call-3-18-25" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-customer-user-group-call-3-18-25</a></p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-alford, <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-customer-user-group-may-12-2026-0100-pm" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-customer-user-group-may-12-2026-0100-pm
DTSTAMP:20251219T011200Z
END:VEVENT
