X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The purpose of this meeting is to provide an opportunity for CAISO to provide any key updates and information relevant after activation, as well as answer Market Participant questions.   </p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Open to all market participants</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>This group will meet every Monday from 9:00a.m. - 10:00a.m. PT &amp; Thursday 1:00pm - 2:00pm PT</p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.webex.com/wbxmjs/joinservice/sites/caiso/meeting/download/545c67fb807e451abd5f0b504dc5fd89?MTID=md592dda61a00761ceff7d456e7178278" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://caiso.webex.com/wbxmjs/joinservice/sites/caiso/meeting/download/545c67fb807e451abd5f0b504dc5fd89?MTID=md592dda61a00761ceff7d456e7178278</a></p></div><div></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/activation-follow-up-dame-edam-edam-caiso-balancing-authority-area-participation-rules-may-04-2026-0900-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
