BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:231482@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260502T130000Z
DTEND:20260503T000000Z
SUMMARY:CANCELED | Extended Day-Ahead Market (EDAM) and Day-Ahead Market Enhancements (DAME) Market Participant Support Bridge
DESCRIPTION:Canceled: For urgent issues, please call the ISO Service Desk at (916) 351-2309 or (888) 889-0450. For non-urgent issues, please open a CIDI inquiry case in the Production environment and select the EDAM/DAME Submission Type.\n\nThe California ISO is opening this support bridge to assist participants during the EDAM/DAME transition. Before raising issues or questions on the bridge, Market Participants are asked to first open a CIDI inquiry case in the Production environment and select the EDAM/DAME Submission Type. This ensures CAISO can properly track inquiries and maintain confidentiality during the call.\nThe support bridge will also be used to proactively communicate any known issues that may affect stakeholder participation.\nWeb participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://caiso.webex.com/caiso/j.php?MTID=mc0c113cd33ee1757093d37bd04f573a8  \n\n\n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-and-day-ahead-market-enhancements-dame-market-participant-support-bridge-may-02-2026-0600-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p><strong>Canceled:</strong> For urgent issues, please call the ISO Service Desk at (916) 351-2309 or (888) 889-0450. For non-urgent issues, please open a CIDI inquiry case in the Production environment and select the EDAM/DAME Submission Type.<br /><br />The California ISO is opening this support bridge to assist participants during the EDAM/DAME transition. Before raising issues or questions on the bridge, Market Participants are asked to first open a CIDI inquiry case in the Production environment and select the EDAM/DAME Submission Type. This ensures CAISO can properly track inquiries and maintain confidentiality during the call.</p><p>The support bridge will also be used to proactively communicate any known issues that may affect stakeholder participation.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.webex.com/caiso/j.php?MTID=mc0c113cd33ee1757093d37bd04f573a8" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://caiso.webex.com/caiso/j.php?MTID=mc0c113cd33ee1757093d37bd04f573a8</a></p></div><div></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-and-day-ahead-market-enhancements-dame-market-participant-support-bridge-may-02-2026-0600-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-and-day-ahead-market-enhancements-dame-market-participant-support-bridge-may-02-2026-0600-am
