SUMMARY:Comments due - Extended Day-ahead Market (EDAM) Congestion Revenue Allocation
DESCRIPTION:Please use the Commenting Tool to submit comments on this topic to the California ISO.\nRelated information: https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Extended-day-ahead-market \n\nChristina Guimera, cguimera@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-extended-day-ahead-market-edam-congestion-revenue-allocation-may-01-2026-1200-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>Please use the <a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/Account/Login?ReturnUrl=/Comments/MyOrgComments" rel="noreferrer noopener">Commenting Tool</a> to submit comments on this topic to the California ISO.</p><p>Related information: <a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Extended-day-ahead-market" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Extended-day-ahead-market</a></p></div><div><p>Christina Guimera, <a href="mailto:cguimera@caiso.com">cguimera@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-extended-day-ahead-market-edam-congestion-revenue-allocation-may-01-2026-1200-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
